On a changed-mind Drive Up return of an electronics-class line of a Northgate Same-Day Delivery order under **Northgate Store and Online Orders**, the **restocking addition for how long the item was kept** is counted in calendar days from the fulfilled date to the return date, the fulfilled date left out and the return date included:

- more than fourteen days: adds 5 percent;
- eight to fourteen days: adds 2 percent;
- seven days or fewer: adds nothing.

**Both sides of each threshold (hypothetical, fulfilled 2 May).** A return on 17 May (15 days) adds 5 percent; on 16 May (14 days) adds 2 percent; on 10 May (8 days) adds 2 percent; on 9 May (7 days) adds nothing.
